WEBVTT

00:07:26.741 --> 00:07:30.075
but I'm a very average person
with above-average communication skills.

00:07:30.099 --> 00:07:33.464
In 2013, I went through
a tough period in my life.

00:07:33.488 --> 00:07:36.879
But it turns out, I was going through
a tough period at the exact moment

00:07:36.903 --> 00:07:39.271
a lot of people were going
through a tough period,

00:07:39.295 --> 00:07:41.135
and it was the same kind of toughness.

00:07:41.159 --> 00:07:43.991
It was a loss of social connection
and a sense of isolation.

00:07:44.015 --> 00:07:46.084
So in my case, I had gone
through a divorce.

00:07:46.108 --> 00:07:47.260
My kids had left home.

00:07:47.284 --> 00:07:50.585
A lot of my friends were conservatives,
but conservatism was changing,

00:07:50.609 --> 00:07:52.220
so I lost a lot of those friends.

00:07:52.244 --> 00:07:56.537
And so I'm living alone in an apartment
with vast nothing-to-do over the weekends

00:07:56.561 --> 00:07:58.372
because I had no friends of that sort.

00:07:58.396 --> 00:08:02.332
But at the same time, America's gone
through this crisis of isolation.